Modifications made in 2026-10 (see git history for the full record):
- Renamed the package, plugin id and storage root to dsh-ppt-studio.
- Replaced the Planners review-dock integration with a sidebar workbench
  registered through dsh-better-sidebar, plus a project store, a revision-guarded
  HTTP route and a ppt_project agent tool.
- Added native PPTX export built on PptxGenJS, and removed the vendored
  review-dock dependency and its bundled copies.
- Removed the forced planners-review-core dependency from install plans and
  dropped the retired Planners settings page from the client half.
- Added a selectable `ppt-studio` Agent preset. The Agent tools and filesystem
  skill provider are registered in its scope; the global bridge checks the
  session preset before loading the PPT project API. The Settings panel creates
  a new PPT preset session and controls sidebar-entry visibility. Legacy global
  PPT skill aliases are removed only when they resolve to this plugin's own copy.

The DSH Review Dock component shipped by the upstream project is NOT included
in this fork.

Design references (no source copied):
- PPTist (https://github.com/pipipi-pikachu/PPTist), AGPL-3.0-only —
  slide/element model shape, editing interactions and the native export mapping
  were studied and reimplemented for this plugin.
- vercel-labs/skills (https://github.com/vercel-labs/skills), MIT —
  skill discovery and frontmatter handling approach.

